{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794132994938,"sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","part":{"partID":"prt_1baa8e935001Mz7V42FAMrgzW7","sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","messageID":"msg_1baa8dc60001Rppowtgz36Ce6v","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9310e70a0c851d8a","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"wc -l .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml; grep -n \"step_create_state_log\\|step_reduce_state\\|phase_init\\|phase_main_loop\\|phase_synthesis\\|artifact_dir\\|fanout_lineage\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml | head -60"},"output":"    2494 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml\n54:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n108:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n149:  packet_dir: \"{artifact_dir}\"\n150:  config: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-config.json\"\n151:  state_log: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-state.jsonl\"\n152:  status_ledger: \"{artifact_dir}/orchestration-status.log\"\n153:  strategy: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n154:  registry: \"{artifact_dir}/findings-registry.json\"\n155:  dashboard: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-dashboard.md\"\n156:  pause_sentinel: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-research-pause\"\n157:  run_now_sentinel: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-research-run-now\"\n158:  lock_file: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-research.lock\"\n159:  prompt_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/prompts\"\n160:  iteration_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations\"\n161:  iteration_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md\"\n167:  delta_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas\"\n168:  delta_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas/iter-{NNN}.jsonl\"\n169:  research_output: \"{artifact_dir}/research.md\"\n170:  resource_map_output: \"{artifact_dir}/resource-map.md\"\n172:  synthesis_snapshot_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/synthesis-v{generation}.md\"\n182:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n185:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n186:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n188:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n194:        - artifact_dir: \"Resolved research packet directory for this target\"\n199:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n202:        reducer_artifact_arg: \"--artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\"\n208:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n212:      isolated sub-packet under {artifact_dir}/lineages/{label}/.\n214:      deep/research command surface with config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir so the LEAF\n217:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n218:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n219:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n230:            --base-artifact-dir {artifact_dir} \\\n240:  phase_init:\n387:      step_create_state_log:\n1052:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1055:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1058:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1108:          message: 'All next-focus, recovery, and ideas candidates match active rejected patterns. Remove or reset the rejected pattern, or provide a new focus. In a ledger-backed run (a deep-research-ledger/frames folder beside the state log) the next projection replaces a hand-edited state log, so record the removal or reset through the append gateway: write one row to a file, either {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_removed\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"pattern\":\"<rejected text>\",\"category\":\"<its category>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now, e.g. 2026-05-24T00:00:00Z>\"} or {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_reset\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"reason\":\"<why>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now>\"}, then run node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <that file> and rerun the reducer before resuming.'\n1328:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1429:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1531:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1739:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1796:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the research yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1804:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type research --artifact-dir {artifact_dir} --iteration {current_iteration}\"\n1902:      step_reduce_state:\n2014:        source_note: \"step_reduce_state has just rewritten all three, so the freshest view of this lineage is already on disk. No index, daemon or network call is involved.\"\n2142:  phase_synthesis:\n2152:            --artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\n2384:      step_stage_artifact_dir:\n2385:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n2386:        action: \"Stage all skill-owned artifacts under artifact_dir for the operator's next git commit\"\n2388:        note: \"Skill-owned contract fix (028): without this stage step, operators who do `git add research-report.md` lose the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, etc.). Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the audit trail intact. Operators retain commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` to unstage anything before commit. Failure is non-fatal: log warning and continue. The exclude pathspecs keep the live lock file, the pause and run-now sentinels, and the legacy projection watermark directory out of the index; locks-and-fencing-v1, ledgers, deltas, iterations and the state log stay staged.\"\n2389:        on_fail: \"Log warning. Do not block synthesis. The artifact_dir may be outside a git repo (e.g., temp test fixture) which is a valid case.\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"    2494 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml\n54:  trigger: \"At workflow START, before phase_init\"\n108:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n149:  packet_dir: \"{artifact_dir}\"\n150:  config: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-config.json\"\n151:  state_log: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-state.jsonl\"\n152:  status_ledger: \"{artifact_dir}/orchestration-status.log\"\n153:  strategy: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n154:  registry: \"{artifact_dir}/findings-registry.json\"\n155:  dashboard: \"{artifact_dir}/deep-research-dashboard.md\"\n156:  pause_sentinel: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-research-pause\"\n157:  run_now_sentinel: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-research-run-now\"\n158:  lock_file: \"{artifact_dir}/.deep-research.lock\"\n159:  prompt_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/prompts\"\n160:  iteration_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations\"\n161:  iteration_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/iterations/iteration-{NNN}.md\"\n167:  delta_dir: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas\"\n168:  delta_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/deltas/iter-{NNN}.jsonl\"\n169:  research_output: \"{artifact_dir}/research.md\"\n170:  resource_map_output: \"{artifact_dir}/resource-map.md\"\n172:  synthesis_snapshot_pattern: \"{artifact_dir}/synthesis-v{generation}.md\"\n182:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n185:        artifact_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n186:        artifact_root_dir: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}\"\n188:        artifact_archive_root: \"{config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir}/_archive\"\n194:        - artifact_dir: \"Resolved research packet directory for this target\"\n199:    branch_on: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\"\n202:        reducer_artifact_arg: \"--artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\"\n208:    description: \"Spawn fan-out lineages; skip and proceed to phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n212:      isolated sub-packet under {artifact_dir}/lineages/{label}/.\n214:      deep/research command surface with config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir so the LEAF\n217:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n218:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n219:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n230:            --base-artifact-dir {artifact_dir} \\\n240:  phase_init:\n387:      step_create_state_log:\n1052:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1055:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1058:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1108:          message: 'All next-focus, recovery, and ideas candidates match active rejected patterns. Remove or reset the rejected pattern, or provide a new focus. In a ledger-backed run (a deep-research-ledger/frames folder beside the state log) the next projection replaces a hand-edited state log, so record the removal or reset through the append gateway: write one row to a file, either {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_removed\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"pattern\":\"<rejected text>\",\"category\":\"<its category>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now, e.g. 2026-05-24T00:00:00Z>\"} or {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_reset\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"reason\":\"<why>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now>\"}, then run node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <that file> and rerun the reducer before resuming.'\n1328:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1429:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1531:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1739:            const artifactDir = '{artifact_dir}';\n1796:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the research yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1804:          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type research --artifact-dir {artifact_dir} --iteration {current_iteration}\"\n1902:      step_reduce_state:\n2014:        source_note: \"step_reduce_state has just rewritten all three, so the freshest view of this lineage is already on disk. No index, daemon or network call is involved.\"\n2142:  phase_synthesis:\n2152:            --artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\n2384:      step_stage_artifact_dir:\n2385:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n2386:        action: \"Stage all skill-owned artifacts under artifact_dir for the operator's next git commit\"\n2388:        note: \"Skill-owned contract fix (028): without this stage step, operators who do `git add research-report.md` lose the iteration trail (iterations/, deltas/, state.jsonl, strategy, etc.). Staging the whole artifact_dir keeps the audit trail intact. Operators retain commit authority and can `git restore --staged {path}` to unstage anything before commit. Failure is non-fatal: log warning and continue. The exclude pathspecs keep the live lock file, the pause and run-now sentinels, and the legacy projection watermark directory out of the index; locks-and-fencing-v1, ledgers, deltas, iterations and the state log stay staged.\"\n2389:        on_fail: \"Log warning. Do not block synthesis. The artifact_dir may be outside a git repo (e.g., temp test fixture) which is a valid case.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"wc -l .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml; grep -n \\\"step_create_state_log\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\\|phase_init\\\\|phase_main_loop\\\\|phase_synthesis\\\\|artifact_dir\\\\|fanout_lineage\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml | head -60\"}"},"time":{"start":1794132994357,"end":1794132994938}}}}
