{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794133016375,"sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","part":{"partID":"prt_1baa93d360017tYB79TaEYX2ZX","sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","messageID":"msg_1baa93a17001zLSrFJ4ZAS7htI","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8e719134c6458df","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/cli-classifier/006-jev-feature-auto-enable/research/lineages/deepseek-v4-1-flash-max && ls -R | head -40; echo \"=== CONFIG ===\"; cat deep-research-config.json; echo \"=== STATE ===\"; cat deep-research-state.jsonl | head -6"},"output":"BINDING.md\ndeep-research-audit-ledger\ndeep-research-config.json\ndeep-research-dashboard.md\ndeep-research-effect-ledger\ndeep-research-ledger\ndeep-research-state.jsonl\ndeep-research-strategy.md\ndeltas\nevents\nfindings-registry.json\ninvocation-metadata.json\niterations\nlocks-and-fencing-v1\nlogs\nresearch.md\nresource-map.md\n\n./deep-research-audit-ledger:\nframes\n\n./deep-research-audit-ledger/frames:\n0000000000000001.frame\n0000000000000002.frame\n0000000000000003.frame\n0000000000000004.frame\n0000000000000005.frame\n0000000000000006.frame\n0000000000000007.frame\n0000000000000008.frame\n0000000000000009.frame\n0000000000000010.frame\n\n./deep-research-effect-ledger:\nframes\n\n./deep-research-effect-ledger/frames:\n0000000000000001.frame\n0000000000000002.frame\n\n=== CONFIG ===\n{\n  \"topic\": \"Research how to prove, improve, harden, debug, integrate and test the three Jev classifier features that have no clean keep verdict, so each can either earn a live, auto-on path like the four proven features or be retired with evidence. (1) Spec-track narrowing, .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/score-track-narrowing.mjs: its first live run kept (97 right of 256 against ripgrep), but the repeat on a 270-row corpus stopped on margin (106 vs 82, bootstrap interval spanning zero). (2) Routing clarify default, .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/score-clarify-default.cjs: a keep on a fixture corpus (28 vs 15 of 54), while the real router clarifies only 3 of 359 committed prompts and the scorer now refuses rows the router no longer clarifies. (3) Alignment folder suggestion, .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/evals/score-alignment-suggestion.ts: a keep on fixture rows (39 vs 30 of 40), but a distractor-state control turns it to kill (W=0 L=30). For each feature answer: what corpus, labels, keep rule and power would prove a live win or settle a kill; what question, option or input changes would improve accuracy; which failure modes need hardening; where it would plug into a live path behind the shared gate .skilled/skills/cli-classifier/shared/scripts/jev-features.mjs (featureReady, JEV_FEATURE_<NAME>, auto-on with a stored credential) the way cite-drift, the injection screen hook, the reviewer verdict fallback and the D4 hallucination grader now do; and what tests would cover it. Measured history lives in specs/cli-jev/003-cli-jev-workflow-integration/ children 017, 020, 022, 047, 048 and 049. Read only outside your lineage folder. Cite file:line for every claim, give each recommendation a priority (P0 to P2) and say how you confirmed it.\",\n  \"research_topic\": \"Prove, improve, harden, debug, integrate and test the three Jev classifier features without a clean keep verdict (spec-track narrowing, routing clarify default, alignment folder suggestion) so each earns a live auto-on path behind the shared jev-features gate or is retired with evidence.\",\n  \"specFolder\": \"specs/cli-jev/006-jev-feature-auto-enable\",\n  \"artifactDir\": \"specs/cli-jev/006-jev-feature-auto-enable/research/lineages/deepseek-v4-1-flash-max\",\n  \"fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\": \"specs/cli-jev/006-jev-feature-auto-enable/research/lineages/deepseek-v4-1-flash-max\",\n  \"loopType\": \"research\",\n  \"maxIterations\": 5,\n  \"minIterations\": 3,\n  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.05,\n  \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n  \"stopPolicy\": \"max-iterations\",\n  \"stuckThreshold\": 3,\n  \"minIdeaObservations\": 2,\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-04T20:58:11.000Z\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"stopReason\": \"maxIterationsReached\",\n  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"kind\": \"cli-devin\",\n    \"model\": \"deepseek-v4-1-flash-max\"\n  },\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"label\": \"deepseek-v4-1-flash-max\",\n    \"sessionId\": \"fanout-deepseek-v4-1-flash-max-1791147269547-wctu8t\",\n    \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n    \"generation\": 1\n  },\n  \"angles\": \"five questions per feature: (1) corpus, labels, keep rule and power to prove a live win or settle a kill; (2) question, option or input changes that improve accuracy; (3) failure modes needing hardening; (4) where it plugs into a live path behind the shared jev-features gate; (5) what tests would cover it\",\n  \"resource_map\": {\n    \"emit\": true,\n    \"resource_map_present\": false\n  }\n}\n=== STATE ===\n{\"type\":\"config\",\"topic\":\"fanout-deepseek-v4-1-flash-max-1791147269547-wctu8t\",\"maxIterations\":5,\"generation\":1,\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-04T20:58:32.088Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":1,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-jsonl:795fc8f6df8fa1634c9b513fb07d7ec89edfb36f76b188bbf08ec445aac80161:ruled-out:1\",\"legacy-jsonl:795fc8f6df8fa1634c9b513fb07d7ec89edfb36f76b188bbf08ec445aac80161:ruled-out:2\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-04T20:59:01.985Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-jsonl:1be1b85e040ad5464145f1702d78e05798338050903987eb9b887819f81f6353:ruled-out:1\",\"legacy-jsonl:1be1b85e040ad5464145f1702d78e05798338050903987eb9b887819f81f6353:ruled-out:2\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-04T21:00:11.425Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-jsonl:72244ffcd409285519acdf5e7c1103237bffdb4f4a2c170