{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794133104819,"sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","part":{"partID":"prt_1baaa95e30018S6Awk3yaT5HPx","sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","messageID":"msg_1baaa916e001rvOKw7h81yZDVG","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-932c8b67f86953fc","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"QUESTION_TOOLS\" -A6 .skilled/hooks/decision-capture/pi/decision-capture.ts | head -20; echo \"=== DSH names ===\"; grep -n \"ask_user_question\\|tool\\b\\|name\" .skilled/hooks/decision-capture/dsh/decision-capture.mjs | head -20; echo \"=== DSH README ===\"; sed -n '1,60p' .skilled/hooks/decision-capture/dsh/README.md"},"output":"6:import { QUESTION_TOOLS, recoveredRecords } from '../../.skilled/hooks/decision-capture/bin/sweep-pi.mjs';\n7-import { isHookEnabled } from '../../.skilled/hooks/shared/hook-flags.mjs';\n8-\n9-import type { ExtensionAPI } from '@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent';\n10-\n11-/** The fields of a Pi `tool_result` event the capture reads. */\n12-interface PiToolResultEvent {\n--\n54:          || !QUESTION_TOOLS.has(result.toolName)\n55-          || result.isError === true\n56-          || result.details?.cancelled === true\n57-        ) return undefined;\n58-\n59-        const sessionId = sessionContext.sessionManager?.getSessionId?.();\n60-        if (typeof sessionId !== 'string' || sessionId.length === 0) return undefined;\n=== DSH names ===\n11:// change a tool result, and the save-time sweep recovers whatever this misses.\n26:    // A logging failure must not change the tool result.\n45: * Queue every answered `ask_user_question` for the next full-auto save, and\n68:    if (exec?.name !== QUESTION_TOOL || result?.isError) return;\n=== DSH README ===\n---\ntitle: \"DSH Decision Capture: Live Answers and Idle Reminder\"\ndescription: \"DeepSeek Harness adapter that queues answered questions, recovers late replies and injects one save reminder when captured answers wait.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"dsh decision capture\"\n  - \"dsh ask_user_question capture\"\n  - \"dsh answer reminder\"\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# DSH Decision Capture: Live Answers and Idle Reminder\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n`hooks/decision-capture/dsh/` holds the DSH adapter for the decision capture concern. It exports `registerDecisionCapture`, which registers three handlers. One queues an answered `ask_user_question` call, one recovers a late reply to a timed question from the session feed, and one injects a save reminder when the agent goes idle.\n\nThe module declares `ERROR_POLICY = 'fail-open'`. The `repo-guards` plugin bundle imports this adapter from here.\n\n---\n\n## 2. WHAT EACH FILE DOES\n\n| File | Event or role | Behavior | On error |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `decision-capture.mjs` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | Queues answers from `ask_user_question`, recovers `user-question-reply` messages whose source kind matches, and injects one notice at idle when `takeNudge` reports waiting answers. Records are tagged `source: 'hook'`. | Fails open. A throw is logged through `ctx.logger.warn`, and the tool result or turn continues unchanged. |\n\n---\n\n## 3. RELATED\n\n- [`../`](../): the decision capture concern folder.\n- [`../lib/capture-core.mjs`](../lib/capture-core.mjs): the queue core the adapter appends through.\n- [`../bin/sweep-dsh.mjs`](../bin/sweep-dsh.mjs): the sweep that exports `dshAnswerRecords` and `recoveredRecords`.\n- [`../tests/dsh-decision-capture.test.mjs`](../tests/dsh-decision-capture.test.mjs): the tests for this adapter.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"6:import { QUESTION_TOOLS, recoveredRecords } from '../../.skilled/hooks/decision-capture/bin/sweep-pi.mjs';\n7-import { isHookEnabled } from '../../.skilled/hooks/shared/hook-flags.mjs';\n8-\n9-import type { ExtensionAPI } from '@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent';\n10-\n11-/** The fields of a Pi `tool_result` event the capture reads. */\n12-interface PiToolResultEvent {\n--\n54:          || !QUESTION_TOOLS.has(result.toolName)\n55-          || result.isError === true\n56-          || result.details?.cancelled === true\n57-        ) return undefined;\n58-\n59-        const sessionId = sessionContext.sessionManager?.getSessionId?.();\n60-        if (typeof sessionId !== 'string' || sessionId.length === 0) return undefined;\n=== DSH names ===\n11:// change a tool result, and the save-time sweep recovers whatever this misses.\n26:    // A logging failure must not change the tool result.\n45: * Queue every answered `ask_user_question` for the next full-auto save, and\n68:    if (exec?.name !== QUESTION_TOOL || result?.isError) return;\n=== DSH README ===\n---\ntitle: \"DSH Decision Capture: Live Answers and Idle Reminder\"\ndescription: \"DeepSeek Harness adapter that queues answered questions, recovers late replies and injects one save reminder when captured answers wait.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"dsh decision capture\"\n  - \"dsh ask_user_question capture\"\n  - \"dsh answer reminder\"\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# DSH Decision Capture: Live Answers and Idle Reminder\n\n---\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n`hooks/decision-capture/dsh/` holds the DSH adapter for the decision capture concern. It exports `registerDecisionCapture`, which registers three handlers. One queues an answered `ask_user_question` call, one recovers a late reply to a timed question from the session feed, and one injects a save reminder when the agent goes idle.\n\nThe module declares `ERROR_POLICY = 'fail-open'`. The `repo-guards` plugin bundle imports this adapter from here.\n\n---\n\n## 2. WHAT EACH FILE DOES\n\n| File | Event or role | Behavior | On error |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `decision-capture.mjs` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | Queues answers from `ask_user_question`, recovers `user-question-reply` messages whose source kind matches, and injects one notice at idle when `takeNudge` reports waiting answers. Records are tagged `source: 'hook'`. | Fails open. A throw is logged through `ctx.logger.warn`, and the tool result or turn continues unchanged. |\n\n---\n\n## 3. RELATED\n\n- [`../`](../): the decision capture concern folder.\n- [`../lib/capture-core.mjs`](../lib/capture-core.mjs): the queue core the adapter appends through.\n- [`../bin/sweep-dsh.mjs`](../bin/sweep-dsh.mjs): the sweep that exports `dshAnswerRecords` and `recoveredRecords`.\n- [`../tests/dsh-decision-capture.test.mjs`](../tests/dsh-decision-capture.test.mjs): the tests for this adapter.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n \\\"QUESTION_TOOLS\\\" -A6 .skilled/hooks/decision-capture/pi/decision-capture.ts | head -20; echo \\\"=== DSH names ===\\\"; grep -n \\\"ask_user_question\\\\|tool\\\\b\\\\|name\\\" .skilled/hooks/decision-capture/dsh/decision-capture.mjs | head -20; echo \\\"=== DSH README ===\\\"; sed -n '1,60p' .skilled/hooks/decision-capture/dsh/README.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794133104099,"end":1794133104819}}}}
