{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794133120508,"sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","part":{"partID":"prt_1baaad3a0001WoEZ6XPasXQbFo","sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","messageID":"msg_1baaacf910016gtR24w94EYsZF","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-83232feb9dd4519a","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -rn \"Hermes\\|hermes\" .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md | head -20; echo \"=== RUNTIMES DIR ===\"; ls .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/ | head -30"},"output":".skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:2:title: \"v4.0.2.0, DeepSeek Harness Joins and Hermes Leaves\"\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:3:description: \"DeepSeek Harness joins as an experimental CLI with verified routes and the same session hooks as Pi, and Hermes Agent is removed. A session can read back its own history after compaction, a doctor skill keeps a vendored copy's changes across updates and ClickUp tidies pages in your browser.\"\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:8:  - \"hermes agent removed\"\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:17:# v4.0.2.0, DeepSeek Harness Joins and Hermes Leaves\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:23:Hermes Agent leaves. Its executor mode, its `.hermes/` runtime folder and its hooks are gone, so the hub routes seven CLIs.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:29:> Spec folders: `specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation`, `specs/cli-external-orchestration/086-cli-hermes-deprecation`, `specs/system-skilled-doctor/001-skill-and-overlay-build`, `specs/system-speckit/037-symlinked-runtime-root`, `specs/mcp-tooling/026-clickup-doc-divider-spacing`, `specs/sk-doc/055-changelog-system/005-concise-release-format` and `specs/sk-code/019-surface-consistency-research`, `specs/other/004-context-paging`, with smaller packets for the fixes\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:37:ClickUp's clean-up pass ran in an isolated browser, so ClickUp asked for a login on every run. Hermes Agent kept a 177-file runtime folder in step through 553 commits, yet its own session log shows five interactive sessions and none after 2026-10-25.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:47:- **Hermes Agent is removed.** **Breaking:** `cli-hermes`, the `.hermes/` folder and the `hermes` launcher function are gone. <!-- section: Hermes Agent Removed -->\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:110:## Hermes Agent Removed\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:114:**Breaking:** `cli-hermes` is no longer a mode, and deep loops reject it as an executor. The `.hermes/` folder is deleted with its skill copies, prompt templates and `repo-guards` plugin, and a request that names Hermes now routes nowhere.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:118:Session relaunch, the dispatch rules, the orphan sweeper and the pre-commit mirror checks no longer know a `hermes` runtime. `skilled-loop` no longer defines a `hermes` shell function, and AGENTS.md no longer describes Hermes personas.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:207:- **If you used Hermes Agent:** open a new shell so the `hermes` function is gone, and remove `repo-guards` from `plugins.enabled` in `~/.hermes/config.yaml`. Your `~/.hermes/` install itself is untouched.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:38:- **Goals behave the same on every runtime.** Goal commands fail loudly, and live runs fixed Hermes, Pi and OpenCode.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:40:- **Codex runs each hook once, and Cursor gains Grok 4.7.** Smaller fixes reach Hermes, Pi, cli-jev and the deep loops.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:136:- **Hermes** binds through the shared goal core and injects the rendered brief, where it used to inject its raw goal report before the session had bound it.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:176:#### Hermes Skill Copies Link to Real Files\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:178:Hermes reads each skill from a generated copy in `.hermes/skills/`, and the copies kept every relative link as written, so 530 links pointed at files that did not exist. The generator now rewrites each relative link to reach the original file.\n=== RUNTIMES DIR ===\ncommand-scope.cjs\nhook-registry.json\nREADME.md\nsync-gate1-pointers.cjs\nsync-hook-registrations.cjs\nsync-runtime-mirrors.cjs\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:2:title: \"v4.0.2.0, DeepSeek Harness Joins and Hermes Leaves\"\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:3:description: \"DeepSeek Harness joins as an experimental CLI with verified routes and the same session hooks as Pi, and Hermes Agent is removed. A session can read back its own history after compaction, a doctor skill keeps a vendored copy's changes across updates and ClickUp tidies pages in your browser.\"\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:8:  - \"hermes agent removed\"\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:17:# v4.0.2.0, DeepSeek Harness Joins and Hermes Leaves\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:23:Hermes Agent leaves. Its executor mode, its `.hermes/` runtime folder and its hooks are gone, so the hub routes seven CLIs.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:29:> Spec folders: `specs/cli-external-orchestration/085-cli-deepseek-harness-creation`, `specs/cli-external-orchestration/086-cli-hermes-deprecation`, `specs/system-skilled-doctor/001-skill-and-overlay-build`, `specs/system-speckit/037-symlinked-runtime-root`, `specs/mcp-tooling/026-clickup-doc-divider-spacing`, `specs/sk-doc/055-changelog-system/005-concise-release-format` and `specs/sk-code/019-surface-consistency-research`, `specs/other/004-context-paging`, with smaller packets for the fixes\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:37:ClickUp's clean-up pass ran in an isolated browser, so ClickUp asked for a login on every run. Hermes Agent kept a 177-file runtime folder in step through 553 commits, yet its own session log shows five interactive sessions and none after 2026-10-25.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:47:- **Hermes Agent is removed.** **Breaking:** `cli-hermes`, the `.hermes/` folder and the `hermes` launcher function are gone. <!-- section: Hermes Agent Removed -->\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:110:## Hermes Agent Removed\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:114:**Breaking:** `cli-hermes` is no longer a mode, and deep loops reject it as an executor. The `.hermes/` folder is deleted with its skill copies, prompt templates and `repo-guards` plugin, and a request that names Hermes now routes nowhere.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:118:Session relaunch, the dispatch rules, the orphan sweeper and the pre-commit mirror checks no longer know a `hermes` runtime. `skilled-loop` no longer defines a `hermes` shell function, and AGENTS.md no longer describes Hermes personas.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md:207:- **If you used Hermes Agent:** open a new shell so the `hermes` function is gone, and remove `repo-guards` from `plugins.enabled` in `~/.hermes/config.yaml`. Your `~/.hermes/` install itself is untouched.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:38:- **Goals behave the same on every runtime.** Goal commands fail loudly, and live runs fixed Hermes, Pi and OpenCode.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:40:- **Codex runs each hook once, and Cursor gains Grok 4.7.** Smaller fixes reach Hermes, Pi, cli-jev and the deep loops.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:136:- **Hermes** binds through the shared goal core and injects the rendered brief, where it used to inject its raw goal report before the session had bound it.\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:176:#### Hermes Skill Copies Link to Real Files\n.skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md:178:Hermes reads each skill from a generated copy in `.hermes/skills/`, and the copies kept every relative link as written, so 530 links pointed at files that did not exist. The generator now rewrites each relative link to reach the original file.\n=== RUNTIMES DIR ===\ncommand-scope.cjs\nhook-registry.json\nREADME.md\nsync-gate1-pointers.cjs\nsync-hook-registrations.cjs\nsync-runtime-mirrors.cjs\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -rn \\\"Hermes\\\\|hermes\\\" .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.0.md .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.0.2.md | head -20; echo \\\"=== RUNTIMES DIR ===\\\"; ls .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/ | head -30\"}"},"time":{"start":1794133119904,"end":1794133120508}}}}
