{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794133125219,"sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","part":{"partID":"prt_1baaae526002p6MJ9cIvoNnYFL","sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","messageID":"msg_1baaadaf6001JrCCBTU0mpcKi1","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bbbcb3c81fdca2f0","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/hook-registry.json'))\nprint(list(d.keys()))\nfor h in d['hooks']:\n    print(h['id'], '|', h.get('concern','')[:80], '|', list(h.get('bindings',{}).keys()))\n\""},"output":"['_note', 'runtimes', 'hooks']\ncheck-dist-staleness | Report compiled outputs older than their sources | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ncheck-git-hooks | Verify the git hooks sk-git installs are present | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ncompact-inject | Inject recovery context before compaction | ['claude', 'codex']\ncompletion-evidence-stop | Hold a completion claim to its evidence when the assistant stops | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ndecision-capture | Queue operator answers to AskUserQuestion for the next full-auto save | ['claude', 'devin']\ndispatch-audit | Record a finished CLI dispatch in the audit trail | ['claude', 'codex', 'devin']\ndispatch-preflight-lint | Lint a CLI dispatch command against the hard dispatch rules before it runs | ['claude', 'codex', 'devin', 'cursor']\nfable-subagent-guard | Keep Fable sub-agent dispatch inside the approved routes | ['claude']\ngit-live-follow | Start following the live branch | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngit-preflight-advisory | Advise on a git command before it runs | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngit-message-gate | Refuse a commit message, PR description or branch name that breaks the repositor | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngit-primary-reconcile | Reconcile clean local drift with the live branch in the background | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngoal-inject | Inject the bound packet's goal and the resend reminder | ['cursor', 'devin']\ninjection-screen | Screen fetched web text for instructions aimed at an AI agent | ['claude', 'devin']\ninstall-codex-hooks | Report drift between the Codex hook installer and the installed hooks | ['claude', 'cursor', 'devin']\nmcp-route-guard | Route a native MCP call through the registered transport policy | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\noverlay-guard | Refuse a write to a file a vendored tree's overlay owns, naming the overlay file | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\npermission-request-policy | Answer a permission request from the spec gate and dispatch rules | ['devin']\npost-compaction | Recover context after compaction | ['devin']\npost-edit-quality | Run the post-edit quality checks on a written or edited file | ['claude', 'codex', 'devin']\npost-tool-use | Post-tool spec-kit bookkeeping | ['cursor']\nprecompact | Inject recovery context before compaction | ['cursor']\nsession-cleanup | Clean up session-scoped state at session end | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\nsession-end | Persist session context at session end | ['cursor']\nsession-relaunch | Hand a session near its context limit to a fresh one under skilled-loop | ['claude', 'codex']\nsession-start | Prime the session with continuity and workspace context | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\nsession-stop | Persist session context when the assistant stops | ['claude', 'codex', 'devin']\nspec-gate-classify | Classify the prompt for Gate 3 before any tool runs | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\nspec-gate-enforce | Block a file mutation until Gate 3 has bound a spec folder | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\nspec-gate-prebind | Establish Gate 3 state at session start where the prompt event is not delivered | ['cursor']\ntask-dispatch-guard | Guard sub-agent dispatch against out-of-policy task calls | ['claude', 'cursor', 'devin']\nuser-prompt-submit | Run the skill advisor on the submitted prompt | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\nworktree-guard | Warn when the session opens in the wrong worktree | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"['_note', 'runtimes', 'hooks']\ncheck-dist-staleness | Report compiled outputs older than their sources | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ncheck-git-hooks | Verify the git hooks sk-git installs are present | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ncompact-inject | Inject recovery context before compaction | ['claude', 'codex']\ncompletion-evidence-stop | Hold a completion claim to its evidence when the assistant stops | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ndecision-capture | Queue operator answers to AskUserQuestion for the next full-auto save | ['claude', 'devin']\ndispatch-audit | Record a finished CLI dispatch in the audit trail | ['claude', 'codex', 'devin']\ndispatch-preflight-lint | Lint a CLI dispatch command against the hard dispatch rules before it runs | ['claude', 'codex', 'devin', 'cursor']\nfable-subagent-guard | Keep Fable sub-agent dispatch inside the approved routes | ['claude']\ngit-live-follow | Start following the live branch | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngit-preflight-advisory | Advise on a git command before it runs | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngit-message-gate | Refuse a commit message, PR description or branch name that breaks the repositor | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngit-primary-reconcile | Reconcile clean local drift with the live branch in the background | ['claude', 'codex', 'cursor', 'devin']\ngoal-inject | Inject the bound packet's goal and the resend reminder | ['cursor', 'devin']\ninjection-screen | Screen fetched web text for instructions aimed at an AI agent | ['claude', 'devin']\ninstall-codex-hooks | Report drift between the Codex hook installer and the installed hooks |