{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794133504385,"sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","part":{"partID":"prt_1bab0ac54001WtS5ZQBot8mUtp","sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","messageID":"msg_1bab09f12001Z5wioygjYUjB9g","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9eb2a03916e5285","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -rn \"ask_user_question\" .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness .dsh 2>/dev/null | head -10; echo \"=== DEVIN STOP ===\"; python3 -c \"\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('.devin/hooks.v1.json'))\nprint(list(d.keys())[:10])\nfor g in d.get('Stop',[]) if isinstance(d.get('Stop'),list) else []:\n    print(g.get('hooks',[{}])[0].get('command','')[:120])\n\"; echo \"=== DEVIN HOOK CONTRACT ===\"; grep -rn \"Stop\" .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-devin/SKILL.md | head -10"},"output":".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md:27:- **More guards and context run on DSH.** The overlay guard refuses a write to a file an overlay owns, context returns after compaction and answers to `ask_user_question` are captured live. `/speckit:save` runs `sweep-dsh.mjs` to recover any answer the live capture missed.\n.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/references/guards-and-hooks.md:107:| `decision-capture` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | `ask_user_question` answers and late timed replies | Log and continue |\n.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md:94:| `decision-capture` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | `ask_user_question` answers and late timed replies | runs, headless has no question tool | Log and continue |\n.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md:27:| `decision-capture.mjs` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | Captures `ask_user_question` answers and late replies into the record queue. | Fails open. The save-time sweep recovers missed records. |\n=== DEVIN STOP ===\n['SessionStart', 'UserPromptSubmit', 'PreToolUse', 'PostToolUse', 'PermissionRequest', 'Stop', 'PostCompaction', 'SessionEnd']\nbash -c 'cd \"${DEVIN_PROJECT_DIR:-$PWD}\" && node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/session-stop.j\n=== DEVIN HOOK CONTRACT ===\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md:27:- **More guards and context run on DSH.** The overlay guard refuses a write to a file an overlay owns, context returns after compaction and answers to `ask_user_question` are captured live. `/speckit:save` runs `sweep-dsh.mjs` to recover any answer the live capture missed.\n.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness/references/guards-and-hooks.md:107:| `decision-capture` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | `ask_user_question` answers and late timed replies | Log and continue |\n.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md:94:| `decision-capture` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | `ask_user_question` answers and late timed replies | runs, headless has no question tool | Log and continue |\n.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md:27:| `decision-capture.mjs` | `tools/result`, `session/event`, `agent/status` | Captures `ask_user_question` answers and late replies into the record queue. | Fails open. The save-time sweep recovers missed records. |\n=== DEVIN STOP ===\n['SessionStart', 'UserPromptSubmit', 'PreToolUse', 'PostToolUse', 'PermissionRequest', 'Stop', 'PostCompaction', 'SessionEnd']\nbash -c 'cd \"${DEVIN_PROJECT_DIR:-$PWD}\" && node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/session-stop.j\n=== DEVIN HOOK CONTRACT ===\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -rn \\\"ask_user_question\\\" .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-deepseek-harness .dsh 2>/dev/null | head -10; echo \\\"=== DEVIN STOP ===\\\"; python3 -c \\\"\\nimport json\\nd=json.load(open('.devin/hooks.v1.json'))\\nprint(list(d.keys())[:10])\\nfor g in d.get('Stop',[]) if isinstance(d.get('Stop'),list) else []:\\n    print(g.get('hooks',[{}])[0].get('command','')[:120])\\n\\\"; echo \\\"=== DEVIN HOOK CONTRACT ===\\\"; grep -rn \\\"Stop\\\" .skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-devin/SKILL.md | head -10\"}"},"time":{"start":1794133503060,"end":1794133504385}}}}
