{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794133591338,"sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","part":{"partID":"prt_1bab2010c001nWkFPszZRRIeFP","sessionID":"ses_e45574eb5fferLWklFUKCqoqXo","messageID":"msg_1bab1fa1e001Od4C3KuO3x1INy","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c112ae85be0319f","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement --artifact-dir specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement/research/lineages/deepseek >/tmp/reduce3.out 2>&1; echo \"EXIT=$?\"; grep -E '\"iterationsCompleted\"|\"corruptionCount\"' /tmp/reduce3.out; node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type research --artifact-dir specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement/research/lineages/deepseek --iteration 3; echo \"EXIT=$?\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md | head -8"},"output":"EXIT=0\n  \"iterationsCompleted\": 3,\n  \"corruptionCount\": 0,\nOK iteration 3 complete: narrative + route-proof + delta\nWARNING route proof for iteration 3 came from deltas/iter-003.jsonl; the deep-research-state.jsonl projection carries no leaf dispatch fields\nEXIT=0\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] Per runtime: does an ask tool exist, what is its exact name, and is it always available or gated by a mode or flag?\n- [ ] Per runtime: which hook or plugin event can deterministically detect a turn that ends in a prose option menu with no ask-tool call, and block or re-prompt it? Which events can only observe?\n- [ ] What detector heuristic works (lettered or numbered option list plus a question near the end of the last assistant message, with no ask-tool call in the turn), and what is its false-positive risk on ordinary numbered steps, summaries and code blocks?\n- [ ] How should this be wired through hook-registry.json, sync-hook-registrations.cjs and the .skilled/hooks/<name>/<runtime>/ layout, reusing the decision-capture adapters, with the loop guard, sync versus async, and the escape hatch?\n- [ ] What exact rule-text amendments should go into communication-handoff.md §4/§5 and AGENTS.md Gate 3 inside the REPO RULES.md ask-surface carve-out, and should the prose fallback stay for runtimes without a tool?\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"EXIT=0\n  \"iterationsCompleted\": 3,\n  \"corruptionCount\": 0,\nOK iteration 3 complete: narrative + route-proof + delta\nWARNING route proof for iteration 3 came from deltas/iter-003.jsonl; the deep-research-state.jsonl projection carries no leaf dispatch fields\nEXIT=0\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] Per runtime: does an ask tool exist, what is its exact name, and is it always available or gated by a mode or flag?\n- [ ] Per runtime: which hook or plugin event can deterministically detect a turn that ends in a prose option menu with no ask-tool call, and block or re-prompt it? Which events can only observe?\n- [ ] What detector heuristic works (lettered or numbered option list plus a question near the end of the last assistant message, with no ask-tool call in the turn), and what is its false-positive risk on ordinary numbered steps, summaries and code blocks?\n- [ ] How should this be wired through hook-registry.json, sync-hook-registrations.cjs and the .skilled/hooks/<name>/<runtime>/ layout, reusing the decision-capture adapters, with the loop guard, sync versus async, and the escape hatch?\n- [ ] What exact rule-text amendments should go into communication-handoff.md §4/§5 and AGENTS.md Gate 3 inside the REPO RULES.md ask-surface carve-out, and should the prose fallback stay for runtimes without a tool?\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement --artifact-dir specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement/research/lineages/deepseek >/tmp/reduce3.out 2>&1; echo \\\"EXIT=$?\\\"; grep -E '\\\"iterationsCompleted\\\"|\\\"corruptionCount\\\"' /tmp/reduce3.out; node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type research --artifact-dir specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement/research/lineages/deepseek --iteration 3; echo \\\"EXIT=$?\\\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' specs/hooks-plugins-extensions/027-ask-surface-enforcement/research/lineages/deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md | head -8\"}"},"time":{"start":1794133590284,"end":1794133591338}}}}
